cing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">8.40<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">December 10, 2008<br/>Winter Update 2008</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20081212102232&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Firewalker_Boots_deb9dc.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see  firewalker boots <span class=\"p-attributes\">(Arm:2)</span> <span class=\"p-duration\">that is brand-new</span>.<div class=\"p-reqs\">It can only be wielded properly by players of level 130 or higher.<br/></div><div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 9.50 oz.</div><div class=\"p-flavortext\">Wearing these boots reduces the damage gotten from fiery ground.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>These boots reduce the direct damage from walking on <a href=\"#/wiki/Fire\">Fire Fields</a> by 90% and they also reduce the number of times you burn afterwards (2 instead of 7). They have energy for 60 minutes and can be recharged with an enchanted ruby.\n</p><p>Obtained in a mission of <a href=\"#/quest/the-hidden-city-of-beregar-quest\">The Hidden City of Beregar Quest</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"creature-list-generic no-results\"><li>This item is not dropped by any creatures.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC sells this item.</p></div>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sell_To\">Sell To</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC buys this item.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/quest/dangerous-depths-quest\">Dangerous Depths Quest</a></li><li>Demon Set</li><li>Fields</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Fire\">Fire</a></li><li>Firewalker</li><li>Full Set</li><li>Quests</li><li>Rare Set</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Searing%20Fire\">Searing Fire</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Teneshpar\">Teneshpar</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/the-hidden-city-of-beregar-quest\">The Hidden City of Beregar Quest</a></li><li>Worn Firewalker Boots</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Yalahar\">Yalahar</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["dangerous-depths-quest","the-hidden-city-of-beregar-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"the-hidden-city-of-beregar-quest","quest":"The Hidden City of Bere